  "description": "I have a friend. My night friend, whom I only meet at night. I don't know his name, age, or contact information. All I know is his sculpted, handsome face, his intense gaze that leaves me frozen, and his fierce movements that carried me to a pleasure I'd never experienced before. One day, a month into our relationship, I saw him by chance. During the day. At work.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
